<view class="page"><view class="section-title">资料公开设置</view><view class="card visibility-card" wx:if="{{profile}}"><view class="visibility-tip">默认所有资料均不公开。开启后，仅在对方使用你的导入码时导入对应资料。</view><view class="visibility-row" wx:for="{{visibilityItems}}" wx:key="field"><text>{{item.label}}</text><switch checked="{{item.enabled}}" color="#1684c3" data-field="{{item.field}}" bindchange="changeVisibility" disabled="{{savingVisibility}}"/></view></view><view class="section-title">账号与隐私</view><view class="card notice"><text>✓</text><view><view>个人数据已隔离</view><text>你的联系人、关系和资料仅对当前微信账号可见</text></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!profile}}">正在加载设置</view></view>
